{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The biggest risk in Dubai real estate today isn't buying in a wrong area. It's listening to people whose job is to sell you one.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000001"}], "text": "The biggest risk in Dubai real estate today isn't buying in a wrong area; it's listening to people whose job is to sell you one."}, "title": "Biggest Risk in Dubai Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:89d1041c723b5500", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Biggest Risk in Dubai Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000009", "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000010"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "And these areas are Jumeirah Village Circle, Jumeirah Village Triangle, Dubai Land, Business Bay and Shobha Heartland too.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000010"}], "text": "Areas like Jumeirah Village Circle, Jumeirah Village Triangle, Dubai Land, Business Bay, and Shobha Heartland are listed as high supply zones where buying an average unit is risky due to competition."}, "title": "Listing Danger Zones", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:885c48a773e9f472", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Listing Danger Zones", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000012"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "After Covid, the profile shifted. Family start arriving from Europe, US, Russia, Canada. People used to have houses, gardens, spaces, schools.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000011"}], "text": "After COVID, the profile of people moving to Dubai shifted to families who need different types of homes, such as townhouses and villas, driven by lifestyle needs rather than investors' demands."}, "title": "Family Driven Demand", "topic": "Real Estate Demand"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:693ca8ed994c06a1", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Family Driven Demand", "topic": "Real Estate Demand", "topic_slug": "real-estate-demand"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000011"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Standard apartments are usually not where you start. And here is why. A type of person which is moving to Dubai now, a change.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000010"}], "text": "In Capital Grove, standard apartments are usually not the starting point due to changing demographics and lifestyle needs in Dubai post-COVID."}, "title": "Role of Capital Grove", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:8fe8d941166dfe7f", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Role of Capital Grove", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy", "topic_slug": "real-estate-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "market data, sales and rental transactions and uncover the success and failures of the three investment strategies which are only used by the full-time property investors in Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000002"}], "text": "Use market data, sales and rental transactions to uncover the successes and failures of three investment strategies used by full-time property investors in Dubai. This approach separates marketing noise from informed decisions."}, "title": "Use of Real Estate Data", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:e3027395b48423aa", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Use of Real Estate Data", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The right question is, what do I need this property to do? That's why I'm not going to give you fake ranking of Dubai areas best to worst, because that kind of ranking is exactly how investors make lazy decisions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000008"}], "text": "Instead of asking where the best area in Dubai is, ask what you need the property to do for you, focusing on rental income, capital growth, or capital preservation."}, "title": "Assessing Property Needs", "topic": "Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:ead1ab614327f017", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Assessing Property Needs", "topic": "Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "investment-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000017"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "These areas feel safe because we are globally recognized, easier to sell in any market. That part is real. The mistake is expecting them to behave like early stage growth areas.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000017"}], "text": "In areas globally recognized like Downtown Dubai, properties differ significantly; the good position in a recognized area provides stability and liquidity, though not fast growth."}, "title": "Difference between Good and Average Properties", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:779d33b1e42c54aa", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Difference between Good and Average Properties", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy", "topic_slug": "real-estate-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000015"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "say that the strongest capital growth is not always in the standard departments. In many cases, there was a family driven product like townhouses and villas where real end user demand increased much faster than supply.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000015"}], "text": "The strongest capital growth is in family-driven products like townhouses and villas where end-user demand increases faster than supply, not typical apartments."}, "title": "Family Demand vs. Investor Demand", "topic": "Real Estate Demand"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:7fc30e9733e0db36", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Family Demand vs. Investor Demand", "topic": "Real Estate Demand", "topic_slug": "real-estate-demand"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000020"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So, if you go this to protect capital long term, unique properties and established location, make.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000020"}], "text": "For capital protection long-term, invest in unique properties in established locations, ensuring that the unit has something making it hard to replace."}, "title": "Unique Properties in Established Locations", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:knowledge:2d9cbbaf044f9e98", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Unique Properties in Established Locations", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy", "topic_slug": "real-estate-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000008"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The right question is, what do I need this property to do? That's why I'm not going to give you fake ranking of Dubai areas best to worst, because that kind of ranking is exactly how investors make lazy decisions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000008"}], "text": "The speaker uses rhetorical questions to provoke the audience into reconsidering how they assess property investments by focusing them on property needs rather than market rankings."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Rhetorical Questions on Real Estate Strategy", "topic": "Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:expression:73f6647f64e8f84f", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Rhetorical Questions on Real Estate Strategy", "topic": "Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "investment-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000006"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you expect a steady rent cash flow, the unit that gives you strong rental income is usually not the one which doubles in price. Example. JVC Gemera Village Circle, Emirates Gardens 2 building. One bedroom was sold in May 2022 for five hundred and ten thousand.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000005"}], "text": "The speaker uses specific property examples, detailing sale prices, rental income, and yield percentages, to illustrate differences in investment strategy outcomes."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Anecdotal Illustrations in Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:expression:836b7e138b97e87b", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Anecdotal Illustrations in Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000017"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The mistake is expecting them to behave like early stage growth areas. They won't. You're not buying the fastest growth here. You're buying stability, liquidity, and an asset that holds its value where everything else softens.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000017"}], "text": "The speaker provides context to dispel market myths by contrasting the expected behavior of globally recognized areas with those of early stage growth areas."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Contrast and Exceptions in Real Estate Advice", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:expression:f4d8a7dd74d50ac6", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Contrast and Exceptions in Real Estate Advice", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy", "topic_slug": "real-estate-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000014", "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000015"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "It's around fifty nine point five capital growth in four years. If we annualize it, the returns are approximately thirteen point four percent per year just from price appreciation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000014"}], "text": "The speaker integrates specific metrics like percentage increases and annualized returns in discussions to substantiate claims about capital growth in family-driven property investments."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Usage of Metrics in Real Estate Investment", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:expression:97c75a899cb6f151", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Usage of Metrics in Real Estate Investment", "topic": "Dubai Real Estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000009"], "form": "tone", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The issue is not the area. The issue is buying an average unit in a place where average units are everywhere and high supply zones, you will not competing with the market.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:u000009"}], "text": "The speaker uses a cautionary tone when discussing the pitfalls of investing in areas with high supplies of average units without differentiating factors."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Cautions on Real Estate Missteps", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy"}, "content_hash": "481846275f0a23370289d62c0c2ac659a0dad6f3ee7a7a798ea7d739bd023d61", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327:expression:fb980f099275f014", "metadata_hash": "75d6de02fd294f42b3b17259b1efa2d5350aa3f7ad75cbfd038674d74778d30a", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-31", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "cac48a57272ca8e4b19d9f14215fc88db545eba6a3b7eab58d753a7474a06135", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-31-5-levels-of-dubai-real-estate-from-danger-zones-to-safe-bets-d90891a327", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4YZuEYW4RTs", "title": "Cautions on Real Estate Missteps", "topic": "Real Estate Strategy", "topic_slug": "real-estate-strategy"}
